\section{Shodan Hybrid Fallback Mechanism}

Because the standard Shodan Host API requires a paid subscription, SentinelShark implements an intelligent hybrid fallback system. When no API key is present or when requests return HTTP 401, 403, 404, or 429, the client automatically routes queries to the free \textbf{Shodan InternetDB API} (\texttt{internetdb.shodan.io}), ensuring users receive open port and CVE data at zero cost.

