The SentinelShark user interface is crafted using \textbf{PyQt6}, utilizing a Figma-inspired dark cyberpunk design language. The workspace employs nested \texttt{QSplitter} controls, allowing users to freely adjust the proportions of the packet table, statistics dashboard, dissection tree, and hex viewer. Figure~\ref{fig:ui_screenshot} provides a container for the application interface screenshot.

