% ============================================================
%  CHAPTER 8: PROJECT PORTFOLIO & ENGINEERING ANALYSIS
% ============================================================
\chapter{Project Portfolio \& Engineering Analysis}

\section{Project Genesis \& Engineering Evolution}

The SentinelShark project originated from a recognized gap in existing open-source network analysis tooling: the lack of real-time security intelligence inside high-speed packet sniffers. Over a 12-month engineering lifecycle, the project advanced through four distinct development phases, transitioning from raw socket ingestion experiments into an enterprise-grade dual-ecosystem desktop suite.

\section{Phased Development Roadmap \& Gantt Timeline}

The engineering progression of SentinelShark is captured in the 12-month Gantt roadmap in Figure~\ref{fig:gantt}, detailing the milestones across all four development phases leading to the v2.4.1 production release.

